This directory redistributes a deterministically selected subset of
`data/test.jsonl` (JSON + wrapper-object prefix) together with acquisition
provenance. Item prompts and schemas are not rewritten.

The JSON-path scoring adapter at
`src/inference_engine/benchmarking/ifstruct_validator.py` is adapted from
`ifstruct/validator.py` at the same revision. The YAML extraction path is
omitted because this experiment does not score YAML items.
